Timeline bundles or links the open-source components below. All are under
MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD or ISC (MIT/Apache dual-licensed Rust crates may be used under either).
Full license texts ship with each package (node_modules/<pkg>/LICENSE, ~/.cargo/registry/src/*/<crate>/LICENSE*).
Licenses listed are the packages' declared licenses, from upstream metadata/knowledge; run
`cargo license` / `npx license-checker --production` to regenerate an authoritative list (not run here).

